{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>With a young bull.</b> Its meaning is not that he brings the bull to the sanctuary, but rather that he gives from his own first a bull of sin-offering to make atonement for himself and for the priests. Some say also the Levites, because they found \"and Aaron's name you shall write upon the staff of Levi.\" This is far-fetched; rather, the Levites are reckoned with Israel."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:21.174312658Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}